### Replace with a private LAN endpoint only.
@box = http://192.168.2.114:8090

### Health
GET {{box}}/api/health

### Local player
GET {{box}}/api/status

### System / battery / Wi-Fi quality
GET {{box}}/api/system

### Spotify
GET {{box}}/api/spotify/status

### Local pause
POST {{box}}/api/command
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"pause"}

### Local volume - raw server scale, NOT percent
POST {{box}}/api/command
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"volume","value":25}

### Spotify pause
POST {{box}}/api/spotify/command
Content-Type: application/json

{"action":"pause"}

### TTS - do not store real private text in committed fixtures
POST {{box}}/api/speak
Content-Type: application/json

{"source_type":"android-app","source_ref":"mupibox-control","text":"Testansage"}

### Admin auth state (future config phase)
GET {{box}}/api/admin/auth

### Connectivity endpoints below may require an authenticated admin session remotely.
### Do not place real passwords in this committed file.
GET {{box}}/api/connectivity/wifi/adapters

### Bluetooth performs an expensive scan: run manually only.
GET {{box}}/api/connectivity/bluetooth
